  "label": "intended audience",
  "description": "The meme is designed for an audience that finds humor in racially charged stereotypes, particularly those involving the dehumanizing comparison of Black people to apes. The target community likely includes individuals who are unaware of or indifferent to the historical and systemic harm caused by such tropes, and who may be entertained by the absurdity of the fictional narrative presented. The meme relies on the audience's familiarity with the 'wheelbarrow pusher' stereotype and the broader anti-Black racial caricature of equating Black people with chimpanzees, suggesting the target audience is not necessarily composed of members of the Black community, but rather individuals who consume internet humor that exploits offensive racial stereotypes without critical awareness or sensitivity.",
